Only headers and provenance/license data are imported.  LumeOS does not
vendor or link the package's libc++.a, libc++abi, or libunwind.  The kernel's
KTL configuration overlay under lib/ktl and compiler builtins are maintained
separately.  In particular, Linux/Fuchsia userland __config_site files from
the prebuilt package are intentionally not imported.
